# nested node_modules / build output anywhere (e.g. spraypaint-web app)
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/dist/
# The Next.js static export. `next.config.ts` sets `distDir: "out"`, so this is
# the same class of artifact as `**/dist/` above and the rule there does not
# reach it. CI rebuilds it in the `ui` job and copies it into
# spraypaint/ui/dist/ before `cargo build`; committing it would put a large
# machine-generated diff in front of every UI change.
spraypaint-web/spraypaint-web/out/
