# spraypaint (split-attention search tool)
/spraypaint/target/
.spraypaint/

# The exported UI embedded into the binary is a build artifact, covered by the
# `**/dist/` rule above — CI rebuilds it in the `ui` job and drops it here before
# `cargo build`. But `#[folder = "ui/dist/"]` in src/ui.rs is resolved at compile
# time, so the directory must exist in a fresh clone or the crate does not build
# at all. Un-ignore just the marker file. Un-ignoring the directory first is
# required: git will not descend into an excluded directory to find the
# exception inside it.
!/spraypaint/ui/dist/
/spraypaint/ui/dist/*
!/spraypaint/ui/dist/.gitkeep
